@@ -0,0 +1,367 @@
+/* Implementation of the `__builtin_available' availability-check
+   expression shared by the C and C++ front ends.  See c-availability.h for
+   the public entry points and the semantics of the expression.  This is the
+   GCC analog of Clang's `__builtin_available' / `@available' facility.
+
+   Copyright (C) 2026 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+
+This file is part of GCC.
